{"annotations": [], "blocks": [{"bbox": [36.8503, 62.76988259999996, 287.94738533, 191.80667646666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 0, "source": "docling", "text": "precludes the ability to make a universal recommendation for the use or no use of anticoagulant prophylaxis for most pediatric populations addressed in these guidelines. Instead, until more evidence becomes available, the panel emphasizes that the decision to use anticoagulant prophylaxis for VTE prevention in pediatric patients should be individualized and based on a careful assessment of the individual patient's thrombotic and bleeding risks, and the patient's values and preferences. Although specific subgroups of pediatric patients within the broader pediatric populations assessed in these guidelines might benefit from anticoagulant prophylaxis, these subgroups of patients require better definitions and the investigation of targeted anticoagulant strategies."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 199.7949066, 287.94519099719986, 350.7154894666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 1, "source": "docling", "text": "Throughout the guidelines, the panel emphasized the urgent need for high-quality evidence, including evidence derived from adequately powered RCTs investigating the safety and efficacy of anticoagulant prophylaxis for VTE prevention across different pediatric subgroups. Additionally, the panel identified the critical need for the development, validation, and further refinement of risk assessment models that can permit the early identification of those subgroups of pediatric patients at high risk of VTE and low risk of bleeding who may benefit from anticoagulant prophylaxis. Furthermore, future research is needed to evaluate the safety and efficacy of different anticoagulant agents, particularly DOACs, and to determine their optimal dosing, timing, and duration across various clinical scenarios. Finally, there is a need to better understand the impact of long-term anticoagulant prophylaxis on the QoL of pediatric patients."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 363.0687094, 269.51446389999995, 374.32244353333334], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 2, "source": "docling", "text": "Revision or adaptation of the guidelines"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 381.42640339999997, 208.56965139999997, 390.80453086666665], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 3, "source": "docling", "text": "Plans for updating these guidelines"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 397.5408786, 287.9406318, 427.93240846666663], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 4, "source": "docling", "text": "After publication of these guidelines, ASH and ISTH will maintain them through surveillance for new evidence, ongoing review by experts, and regular revisions."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 435.6813774, 262.5400424, 445.05950486666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 5, "source": "docling", "text": "Updating or adapting recommendations locally"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 451.85289059999997, 287.9244964, 482.1879324666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 6, "source": "docling", "text": "Adaptation of these guidelines will be necessary in many circumstances. These adaptations should be based on the associated EtD frameworks. 87"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 497.0336754, 142.6888003, 508.28740953333335], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 7, "source": "docling", "text": "Acknowledgments"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 514.6118925999999, 287.90713139999997, 534.0054824666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 8, "source": "docling", "text": "The panel acknowledges Meghin Brooks (American Society of Hematology) and Andrea Hickman (International Society on Thrombosis"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 553.3297114, 101.3361094, 564.5834455333334], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 9, "source": "docling", "text": "References"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 585.5591473, 556.709656, 602.9926739], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 10, "source": "docling", "text": "Qaseem A, Forland F, Macbeth F, et al. Guidelines International Network: toward international standards for clinical practice guidelines. Ann Intern Med . 2012;156(7):525-531."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 608.4628183, 556.9168308999999, 625.9537339], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 11, "source": "docling", "text": "Schünemann HJ, Al-Ansary LA, Forland F, et al. Guidelines International Network: principles for disclosure of interests and management of conflicts in guidelines. Ann Intern Med . 2015;163(7):548-553."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 631.3665053, 556.8793848999999, 648.8574209], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 12, "source": "docling", "text": "Graham R, Mancher M, Wolman DM, Greenfield S, Steinberg E; Institute of Medicine. Clinical Practice Guidelines We Can Trust . National Academies Press; 2011."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 654.2701913, 556.9017825999999, 671.7610989], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 13, "source": "docling", "text": "Alonso-Coello P, Oxman AD, Moberg J, et al. GRADE Evidence to Decision (EtD) frameworks: a systematic and transparent approach to making well informed healthcare choices. 2: clinical practice guidelines. BMJ . 2016;353:i2089."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 677.1738553, 556.9216309999999, 694.6647709], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 14, "source": "docling", "text": "Alonso-Coello P, Schünemann HJ, Moberg J, et al. GRADE Evidence to Decision (EtD) frameworks: a systematic and transparent approach to making well informed healthcare choices. 1: introduction. BMJ . 2016;353:i2016."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 700.1341213, 556.8913707, 717.5684569], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 15, "source": "docling", "text": "Atkins D, Eccles M, Flottorp S, et al. Systems for grading the quality of evidence and the strength of recommendations I: critical appraisal of existing approaches The GRADE Working Group. BMC Health Serv Res . 2004;4(1):38."}, {"bbox": [476.6666666666667, 733.3333333333334, 510.0, 749.3333333333334], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 16, "source": "docling", "text": "blood"}, {"bbox": [507.3333333333333, 734.0, 558.6666666666666, 750.6666666666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 17, "source": "docling", "text": "advances"}, {"bbox": [305.856049, 62.772873600000025, 556.9014223580001, 82.22379046666674], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 18, "source": "docling", "text": "and Haemostasis) for their support and coordination of the process and without whom this work would not have been possible."}, {"bbox": [305.857971, 97.06565739999996, 369.11240510000005, 108.31939153333326], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 19, "source": "docling", "text": "Authorship"}, {"bbox": [305.857971, 114.58689860000004, 556.9286164, 232.62485246666665], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 20, "source": "docling", "text": "Contribution: All panel members contributed to specific subsections of text for both recommendations and implementation guidelines; M.B., P.M., and L.R. organized and then revised these subsections into the fi rst draft of the manuscript and subsequently revised the manuscript based on authors' suggestions; all guideline panel members critically reviewed the manuscript and provided suggestions for improvement; M.A., H.K., and J.K. (members of the systematic review team) contributed evidence summaries to the guidelines; P.M. (cochair), R.A.M. (cochair), and M.B. ('cochair in training') led the panel meetings; and all authors approved the content."}, {"bbox": [305.857971, 240.61399859999995, 556.906294462, 303.88730346666665], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 21, "source": "docling", "text": "Conflict-of-interest disclosure: All authors were members of the guideline panel or members of the systematic review team or both. As such, they completed a disclosure-of-interest form, which was reviewed by American Society of Hematology/International Society on Thrombosis and Haemostasis and is available as supplements 2 and 3."}, {"bbox": [305.857971, 503.6670686, 556.9133828, 534.0021414666667], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 28, "seq": 22, "source": "docling", "text": "Correspondence: Marisol Betensky, Pediatrics, Johns Hopkins All Children's Hospital, 501 6th Ave S, St. Petersburg, FL 33701; email: marisol.betensky@jhmi.edu."}], "checksum": "154743515767d4792490616615c089bd52f6cc59356493cfeb94706f53896137", "content_present": true, "doc_id": "d-97b717427b6bf503", "docling_version": "2.118.0", "engine_version": "2.118.0", "errors": [], "images": [{"bbox": [469.2630536216734, 735.3787795224133, 556.5552926185456, 746.728186299627], "blob": "", "caption": "", "checksum": "516ea6a73f7c3baa958d97ec29b857d5d54d79266ab3a67cd8360c948b22c4ea", "mime": "image/png", "page": 28, "storage_ref": ""}], "page_index": 27, "page_sizes": {"28": [593.9719848632812, 782.9860229492188]}, "route": "docling", "schema_version": "v0.1.0", "source_hash": "97b717427b6bf503d2817d27c02c788bde996058c4ef8ebaee3678ae31782ea1", "status": "ok", "tables": [{"bbox": [304.8383442375131, 310.331404867136, 557.4474624527448, 495.393927739788], "body_bottom": 484.6799364666666, "caption": "", "cell_bboxes": [[[305.857971, 322.8179176, 398.4269011943998, 331.27005546666663], [404.899506, 311.8764806, 556.8847934, 331.27005546666663]], [[305.857971, 333.7593846, 399.3468371943999, 342.2115224666666], [407.847595, 333.7593846, 556.8847934, 342.2115224666666]], [[305.857971, 344.7582246, 409.7969985915998, 353.21036246666665], [420.773254, 344.7582246, 556.8974697887996, 353.21036246666665]], [[305.857971, 355.6996616, 397.0537412, 364.15179946666666], [403.198608, 355.6996616, 556.9062603943999, 364.15179946666666]], [[305.857971, 366.6411286, 397.0537412, 375.09326646666665], [401.668091, 366.6411286, 556.8847934, 375.09326646666665]], [[305.857971, 377.6399386, 398.41793499439984, 386.09207646666664], [404.899506, 377.6399386, 556.8847934, 386.09207646666664]], [[305.857971, 388.5814056, 392.1828651943998, 407.9750114666666], [384.489746, 388.5814056, 556.9046294000001, 407.9750114666666]], [[305.857971, 410.4643096, 377.8459065943999, 418.9164474666666], [385.85083, 410.4643096, 556.8847934, 418.9164474666666]], [[305.857971, 421.4631806, 398.97025679439986, 429.91531846666663], [533.931213, 421.4631806, 556.8847934, 429.91531846666663]], [[378.65097, 432.4046176, 403.3799109915997, 440.85675546666664], [533.931213, 432.4046176, 556.8847934, 440.85675546666664]], [null, [407.450378, 4